  "body": "Beautifully crafted in solid brick and cedar, this inviting two-level residence offers an exceptional blend of timeless character, comfort and effortless modern living. With three bedrooms, two bathrooms and two separate toilets,  separate laundry, single internal-access garage and excellent storage, it is thoughtfully designed for both relaxed family life and stylish entertaining.\r\n\r\nBathed in natural light and oriented to embrace its prized northern aspect, the home feels warm, uplifting and wonderfully connected to its surroundings. Seamless indoor-outdoor flow extends to a generous timber deck and garden, creating an idyllic setting for sun-drenched morning coffees, leisurely afternoons and memorable gatherings with family and friends.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned on the flat, this enviable address is just an easy five-minute stroll from the vibrant heart of St Heliers Village, the beach, park and an excellent selection of local amenities. Everything you need is close at hand, while the setting retains a sense of peace and ease.\r\n\r\nOffering enduring quality, beautifully considered spaces and an outstanding location, this is more than a home-it is an invitation to embrace the very best of the St Heliers lifestyle.",
